---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy & preview information"
  description="How the JBAEL design preview handles form fields, file selection and external links."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">V0.6.1 DESIGN REVIEW</p>
      <h1>Privacy & preview information</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container reading">
      <p>
        This version is a website design preview. It does not accept enquiries
        or job applications.
      </p>
      <h2>Forms and selected files</h2>
      <p>
        Form values stay in the current browser page. Checking a form validates
        required fields and selected file metadata on your device. It does not
        transmit, upload or save those values or files to JBAEL. Browser
        autofill behaviour is controlled by your browser settings.
      </p>
      <h2>Email and telephone links</h2>
      <p>
        Email and phone links open your chosen email or calling application.
        Sending an email or placing a call through that application is separate
        from this preview.
      </p>
      <h2>Website resources</h2>
      <p>
        Fonts, images and the brochure are served with this website. No
        analytics, advertising trackers or application database have been added.
      </p>
      <h2>Before the live website launches</h2>
      <p>
        Contact details, application handling, email delivery, upload security
        and retention must be confirmed. A final privacy notice will describe
        the actual services and data handling used by the live website.
      </p>
      <a class="button outline" href="/contact/">
        Back to contact
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
